{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The last tank rolls in...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593430/extras/tank_spritesheet-Sheet_triple.gif?t=1748944624\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026 and it brought extra lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter <i>Golgalian</i>, the world's most powerful tank and last hope against the mech horde! Intense action, endless enemies, and scorching sands await in a mission that never gets easier. Dodge barrages of lasers and mortar fire, use the environment to your advantage, and melt steel with unprecedented firepower!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced shooting combat in a bullet hell for anyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six unique power-ups for maximum shooting action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Constantly escalating difficulty in an endless level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of handcrafted, tactical enemy formations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global leaderboard for high score hunters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two biomes: Sand and Road!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593430?t=1748944624","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593430?t=1748944624","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593430/ee305fb5d993a9e32f9f768b7f3fab24ebc7c05c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748944624","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593430/ee305fb5d993a9e32f9f768b7f3fab24ebc7c05c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748944624","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","